4. **Filename (optional)** — `spec-001-package-layout-docs.md` embeds the spec number after the `spec-` prefix. It does not violate the forbidden `NNN-` global-prefix rule, but it can be visually confused with the daemon-assigned prefix on approve. No action required if this is the repo's convention.

